Since April, people have reported bookings landing on the wrong day. The export
dated 4 October records what was received and what was merged into this source ticket.

The desk marked the ticket known and claimed one parser fix would cover it. The
tenant directory and entry paths do not support that claim: the shared parser and
the booking-v3 date hint fail in different ways.

<Callout>
Split by cause. A known status is not evidence that every report has the same cause
or that either problem is fixed.
</Callout>

The [signed review](/kb/incidents/4471-split) explains the evidence and uncertainty.
Track the [parser issue](https://github.com/mikimik01/s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2)
separately from the
[form-hint issue](https://github.com/mikimik01/s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1).

